{"id":"2a69e315370d","publishedAt":1793618602000,"posts":[[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/9/8/983e7724.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"予報通りいい天気のスタート "},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ゆめしま海道に行ってくる"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"・"},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"href":"https://karukantimes.com/archives/51876858.html","text":"https://karukantimes.com/archives/51876858.html"}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" ラーツーとはカップ麺を食べる目的でツーリングに行く事やね "}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" ラーメン屋巡りじゃなくてカップ麺？ "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>10"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"せやで"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"カップ麺はコンビニで買ったよ "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/c/4/c4d2cad0.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"道も空いててスムーズに原付自転車道入口まで辿り着く "}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" 原付とか草 "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>4"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"原付自転車じゃないと見れない景色があるやで "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/d/8/d8aa184f.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ここから見る来島海峡大橋すこ "}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" いーなーここまだ走ったことないわ "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>7"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"晴れてる日に来て欲しい "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/2/8/28819544.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"今日は潮が大きいのか流れも速く感じる "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/6/c/6c79e4cc.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ふっといパイプの威圧感 "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/8/6/8649bde2.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"こんな道を通る"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"上半身が出過ぎてて落ちそう "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/4/9/4924f034.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"亀老山展望台に行く途中に走ってきた来島海峡大橋が見える "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/9/f/9f157e30.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"展望台にも行ってみる"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"亀のオブジェがかわヨ "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/8/8/88ad4faa.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"CMの撮影でも使われるスポット"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"見晴らしが最高 "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/4/5/45bdf82a.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"違う方向も見渡る景色が良い "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/7/e/7ee71515.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"目的のカップ麺タイム"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"大島の公園のこの東屋はお気に入り "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/3/1/3184ac13.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"長めに待って食べるのがすこ "}],[{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" ガチやん"},{"br":1},{"color":"#666666","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"今日の話か？ええ天気で風も気持ちええ日やったな "}],[{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":" >>25"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"今日は天気がマジで最高やったよ "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/d/6/d68aa0a2.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"食べ終えて走ってたら道の真ん中に動くなにかが… "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/7/d/7d24d910.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"Uターンして見たら亀"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"車が3台通過したけど踏まれなくて良かったわ"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"横の草池にリリース "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/c/2/c23a2339.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"少しうろうろしてたら目についた店に入ってみることにした "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/c/1/c1e0c225.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"島レモンのリモーネ島蜂蜜添えと島ライムスカッシュ"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ランチはサラダプレート付き "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/b/6/b6b9fd42.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"しばらくうろうろ走ってみた "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/0/e/0ea6f6ce.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"波が高くならないからなのか道沿いの岸壁がとても低いのでより景色が楽しめれるんだよね "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/4/c/4cce5a3f.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"ここでは2台バイクがとまってた"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"みんな景色を満喫してるんやろね "}],[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/karukan123/imgs/2/1/212b72c4.jpg"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"浜辺にもおりてみた"},{"br":1},{"color":"#3366cc","size":18,"bold":true,"text":"牡蠣の殻が多い "}]],"comments":["ピザも鯛鯛ラーメンも美味そうでええやん","しまなみ海道ってこんな人いないもん？\n時間帯？",">>2\n時期によるかなぁ\n自分は田舎が今治で法事の次いでにレンタルバイクで原２借りて少し回ったけど通常時の平日なら少な目だし、連休や春休みとかは混んでた記憶がある"]}